        </p>
      </div>
      <p>
        Indicatively, the civil divorce targets about a month and the financial claim runs longer if an
        expert is appointed. At the Personal Status Court, law-firm guides put uncontested cases at
        three to six months and contested ones at a year or more.
      </p>
